  "description": "The LoggerLite is a .NET Core and .NET classic compatible solution, featuring one interface ILogger, a handful of implementations and a passive debouncer. The solution is a thin wrapper around .NET FileStreaming, XDocument, Console and other classes. Currently, the project contains following implementations:\n      Console Logger\n      Debug Trace Logger\n      File Logger\n      Xml Logger\n      Yaml Logger\n      JSON Logger\n      Html Logger\n      Aggregate Logger",
  "id": "LoggerLite",
